  "aiContextParagraph": "Following the vacancy left by the departure of Gibran Rakabuming from the vice presidency, President Prabowo Subianto has stated his intention to address the replacement process immediately upon returning from his state visits to Manila, Philippines, and Shenzhen, China. The President remarked that the task requires careful deliberation, metaphorically noting he would await guidance. Meanwhile, political parties and the People's Consultative Assembly are engaged in discussions regarding the selection process. Various names have surfaced in public discourse as potential candidates, including prominent political figures from major parties and the Regional Representative Council. Political coalitions have signaled they will leave the final decision regarding the nomination to the President. The ongoing vacancy has prompted increased public interest and inquiries regarding the timeline and criteria for the appointment, as the administration prepares to navigate the transition in executive leadership.",
